import{_ as a,o as t,c as i,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 744 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Spatial-Law Dispatch System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 744 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Spatial-Law Dispatch System","no":744,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals","Spatial-Law Dispatch","Origin Three Bases","Cross-Plane","Anchor Network"],"related":["13-Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","80-Plane Theory and Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0744_模块4-超多元级功法-空间法理调度体系应用.md","filePath":"en/0744_模块4-超多元级功法-空间法理调度体系应用.md"}'),s={name:"en/0744_模块4-超多元级功法-空间法理调度体系应用.md"};function n(o,e,l,c,p,u){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-744-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-the-spatial-law-dispatch-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 744 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Spatial-Law Dispatch System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-744-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-the-spatial-law-dispatch-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 744 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Spatial-Law Dispatch System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 13, 28, 80</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-upgrade-move-through-space-to-dispatch-the-multiverse-s-spatial-infrastructure" tabindex="-1">Introduction: upgrade &quot;move through space&quot; to &quot;dispatch the multiverse&#39;s spatial infrastructure&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-upgrade-move-through-space-to-dispatch-the-multiverse-s-spatial-infrastructure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: upgrade &quot;move through space&quot; to &quot;dispatch the multiverse&#39;s spatial infrastructure&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Spatial-Law Dispatch System is the Origin Cultivation System&#39;s No. 3 origin base system (number 003). Per benchmark Document 13, its core is perception, positioning, and short-range traversal of spatial laws — storage, teleportation, spatial folding. Under the nine-realm framework, this is a personal spatial tool. But at the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, its role must leap — from &quot;helping one person move house&quot; to &quot;dispatching the entire multiverse&#39;s spatial infrastructure.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are spatial dispatch&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires spatial-resource development go the increment route; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires cross-plane traffic be open fairly to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires the spatial network serve Myriad Ranks&#39; joint uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires cross-plane traversal be strictly reported; the law-first axiom requires spatial laws&#39; definition be self-consistent and stable.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-origin-grade-personal-spatial-operations" tabindex="-1">I. Origin Grade: Personal Spatial Operations <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-origin-grade-personal-spatial-operations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Origin Grade: Personal Spatial Operations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At origin grade, the Spatial-Law Dispatch System&#39;s functions are:</p><ul><li>Open personal storage space, breaking free of physical-container limits;</li><li>Short-range teleportation, raising movement efficiency;</li><li>Spatial perception, identifying nearby spatial cracks and anomalies;</li><li>Laying the foundation for breaking through Dao Integration and Boundary-Breaking Realms.</li></ul><p>This grade is entirely a personal tool — a cultivator&#39;s &quot;backpack&quot; and &quot;ride.&quot; Its ceiling is low, and it involves no civilization-level impact.</p><h2 id="ii-multiverse-grade-inter-plane-traffic-infrastructure" tabindex="-1">II. Multiverse Grade: Inter-Plane Traffic Infrastructure <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-multiverse-grade-inter-plane-traffic-infrastructure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Multiverse Grade: Inter-Plane Traffic Infrastructure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After entering the Multiverse Realm, the Spatial-Law Dispatch System&#39;s service object leaps from individual to cross-plane traffic network:</p><ul><li><strong>Cross-plane anchor connection</strong> (Document 28): establish stable spatial channels between planes, replacing random plane traversal;</li><li><strong>Traffic dispatch system</strong>: manage cross-plane channels&#39; flow, routes, and safety checks, preventing disorderly plane traversal;</li><li><strong>Spatial-resource survey</strong>: probe new planes and new star sectors, evaluating whether their spatial-law structure is suitable for development;</li><li><strong>Disaster-evacuation channel</strong>: reserve safe evacuation routes for doomed planes, protecting Myriad-Rank beings.</li></ul><p>This grade turns spatial ability from &quot;personal ride&quot; into &quot;civilization traffic network.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-hyper-multiverse-grade-cross-cosmos-spatial-law-dispatch" tabindex="-1">III. Hyper-Multiverse Grade: Cross-Cosmos Spatial-Law Dispatch <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-hyper-multiverse-grade-cross-cosmos-spatial-law-dispatch" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Hyper-Multiverse Grade: Cross-Cosmos Spatial-Law Dispatch&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, the Spatial-Law Dispatch System enters a third layer — cross-cosmos spatial-law dispatch. What it manages is no longer plane traffic inside some multiverse, but <strong>spatial relations between multiverses</strong>:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dispatch Direction</th><th>Specific Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cross-cosmos channel construction</td><td>Establish stable spatial bridges between different multiverses, not random traversal</td></tr><tr><td>Spatial-resource reallocation</td><td>Dispatch surplus spatial computable power from resource-rich planes to resource-poor planes</td></tr><tr><td>Predation-channel defense</td><td>Monitor cross-cosmos predation channels, block them without triggering causal war</td></tr><tr><td>Spatial-isolation engineering</td><td>Establish spatial-isolation layers for low-order planes needing independent development, protecting them from disturbance</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension-layer dispatch</td><td>Dispatch spatial resources among the four-layer structure of material plane / energy layer / consciousness domain / law network</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="iv-key-constraint-space-is-not-ownerless-land" tabindex="-1">IV. Key Constraint: Space Is Not Ownerless Land <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-key-constraint-space-is-not-ownerless-land" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Key Constraint: Space Is Not Ownerless Land&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The most common old-web-novel setting is &quot;a strong one may tear open space and leave at will,&quot; as if space is a public corridor. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s spatial-law system does not recognize this freedom:</p><ul><li><strong>Spatial channels have sovereignty</strong>: opening any cross-plane or cross-cosmos channel must be consented by relevant planes&#39; Myriad-Rank representatives;</li><li><strong>Traversal has cost</strong>: every spatial traversal&#39;s energy is borne by the traverser, not &quot;free&quot;;</li><li><strong>Flow is controlled</strong>: Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors all cross-plane traversal; anomalous flow auto-alarms;</li><li><strong>Observe-first-then-interfere</strong>: after arriving at a new plane, observe first then contact; not allowed to start transforming upon landing.</li></ul><p>These constraints ensure spatial ability is not abused as a predation tool of &quot;go wherever you want, grab whatever you want.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: if spatial ability is only used for personal teleportation, it is big-talent-small-use; hyper-multiverse applications turn spatial ability into civilization traffic infrastructure</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cross-cosmos channel construction is throughout reported and supervised, preventing predatory factions from using spatial channels to invade weak planes</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s spatial ability is gift-style — whichever door Gu Chensha wants to open, he opens; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s spatial network is co-governed — every plane has a voice</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: cross-plane traffic is open fairly to Myriad Ranks; the five lineages (carbon/energy/mechanical/consciousness/mixed) each have adapted traversal methods</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: spatial-law dispatch&#39;s technical schemes, channel maps, and safety protocols are all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Spatial-Law Dispatch System upgrades from &quot;helping one person teleport&quot; to &quot;dispatching the whole multiverse&#39;s spatial infrastructure,&quot; essentially redefining space from &quot;a strong one&#39;s private corridor&quot; to &quot;Myriad Ranks&#39; public road.&quot; Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators are this road system&#39;s dispatchers — they dispatch space, but do not own space.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">Entry 13 · Spatial-Law Dispatch System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/28-跨位面锚点连接.html">Entry 28 · Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">Entry 80 · Plane Theory and Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/81-位面穿梭规则.html">Entry 81 · Plane-Travel Rules</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=a(s,[["render",n]]);export{d as __pageData,m as default};
